1 0 0 1 50 750 Tm (INDUSENSE SYNTHETIC MAINTENANCE MANUAL) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 736 Tm (DOCUMENT ID: SYNTH-MAN-CNC-004) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 722 Tm (TITLE: Industrial Spindle Cooling Circuit & Thermal Dissipation Manual) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 708 Tm (STATUS: SYNTHETIC DATASET -- RESEARCH FRAMEWORK ONLY) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 694 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 680 Tm (SECTION 1: SYSTEM OVERVIEW) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 666 Tm (The 5-axis high-speed milling spindle employs a closed-loop ethylene glycol cooling circuit ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 652 Tm (rated for continuous duty up to 24,000 RPM. Auxiliary heat exchangers dissipate stator and ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 638 Tm (bearing thermal losses into the ambient bay atmosphere.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 624 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 610 Tm (SECTION 4.2: HEAT DISSIPATION FAILURE \(HDF\) DIAGNOSTIC PROCEDURE) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 596 Tm (Trigger Criteria:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 582 Tm (- Air Temperature: Ambient sensor T_air) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 568 Tm (- Process Temperature: Stator jacket sensor T_proc) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 554 Tm (- Rotational Speed: Spindle encoder N_rpm) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 540 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 526 Tm (CRITICAL ANOMALY RULE:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 512 Tm (When the temperature difference [T_proc - T_air] falls below 8.6 Kelvin while the rotational ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 498 Tm (speed remains below 1380 RPM, the system is in Heat Dissipation Failure \(HDF\) condition. ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 484 Tm (Under low rotational velocity, reduced fan blade forced convection leads to thermal saturation.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 470 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 456 Tm (MANDATORY CORRECTIVE ACTIONS:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 442 Tm (1. Immediately disengage spindle drive and lock out main 400V breaker.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 428 Tm (2. Inspect auxiliary cooling fan CF-02 for mechanical binding or blade debris accumulation.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 414 Tm (3. Remove and wash suction filter mesh SF-12 using neutral solvent.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 400 Tm (4. Verify glycol coolant line flow rate exceeds nominal 4.2 L/min threshold.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 386 Tm (5. Record inspection sign-off before restarting spindle sequence.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 372 Tm () Tj
